{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114338","id":3130155704,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc66kmK4","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114338","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114338.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114338.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114338","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114338/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114338/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114338/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3bdd5b3d22a93d33d24aa7679c483bff21899dd1","number":114338,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add support for SDL-compatible joypad GUID and `Input.get_joy_info()` on Android","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/56181 (if this PR doesn't fix this issue, then we need to create a mapping for Xbox controllers ourselves)\r\n\r\nThis PR adds support for SDL-compatible joypad GUIDs on Android, so now we should be able to use the mappings from [SDL controller mapping database for Android controllers](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/63227bbc8ae5300319f14f8253c8158b846f355b/core/input/gamecontrollerdb.txt#L1828) that start with `0500`, while still keeping the compatibility with mappings that use the older GUID format (if a mapping with the new format can't be found, the code tries to find one with the old format).\r\nThis PR adds support for `Input.get_joy_info()` for Android as well.\r\n\r\nSee also [SDL's `Android_AddJoystick`](https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/blob/ec1d66d4f693b367ff60f01eac74406b3615fbed/src/joystick/android/SDL_sysjoystick.c#L308C112-L308C123), [SDL's `SDLControllerManager`](https://github.com/libsdl-org/SDL/blob/release-3.2.x/android-project/app/src/main/java/org/libsdl/app/SDLControllerManager.java#L347), and the way GUID was constructed in Godot's Linux joypad driver prior to the SDL3 joystick driver PR [here](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/987832be460f82206fcac1467e58efbd111c5241/platform/linuxbsd/joypad_linux.cpp#L411).\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>DualShock 4 GUID before this PR</summary>\r\n\r\n(Ignore that there's no fingerprint sensor here, it's a screenshot with a different PR applied)\r\n![Screenshot_2025-12-25-18-17-15-579_org godotengine editor v4 debug](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6af143e6-5a40-4a63-b921-37ca221c2386)\r\n</details>\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>DualShock 4 GUID after this PR + Input.get_joy_info()</summary>\r\n\r\n![Screenshot_2025-12-25-21-29-55-945_org godotengine editor v4 debug](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/52cdef91-9316-4524-a131-22d85aaac08d)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] Use SDL's internal mapping database\r\n- [x] Add a note saying that changing the GUID-generating code to be different from SDL will make some GUIDs incompatible\r\n- [ ] Fix swapped triggers issue by looking at SDL's Android code (for separate PR)\r\n- [x] Fix triggers being mapped to [-1;1] on my Xbox One controller without breaking my Dualshock 4 triggers\r\n- [x] If a mapping for an old GUID exists while a mapping for a new one doesn't, fallback to old mapping format\r\n- [ ] Don't introduce regressions for Nvidia Shield axis mapping (for separate PR)\n- [ ] Make the CI pass","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-12-25T16:40:56Z","updated_at":"2026-05-17T06:11:37Z","closed_at":"2026-05-17T06:11:23Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Nintorch:android-sdl-guid","ref":"android-sdl-guid","repo":{"id":975699303,"node_id":"R_kgDOOif9Zw","name":"godot","full_name":"Nintorch/godot","owner":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v